/-!
Tests that a command that the formatter keeps as in the input and that spans several lines keeps
its column. Otherwise its first line moves relative to its other lines, and a block whose lines
must start in the same column no longer parses. The identifier below is wider than the optimality
cutoff width, so the formatter cannot format the commands that use it.
-/

theorem llllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllll : True := trivial

